{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeth Cutter is a collection of short horror stories. Each scenario is trying to deliver you something terrifying.\u00a0 Experience multiple distinct horror scenarios, each lasting from a few minutes to half an hour.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A FEW STORY EXAMPLES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Intruder</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man comes home from work to find that someone is in his house. What will he do to this heinous intruder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.poster.avif?t=1763566865\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.webm?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.mp4?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Father Martin Is Missing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a private investigator looking for a lost father of a newly constructed church. Read his notes and investigate the area to find out what happened to him. Hear the sounds of God's breath.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.poster.avif?t=1763566865\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.webm?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.mp4?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>My One Day Off</u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a man who gets one day off from his blue collar physical labor job, and all he wants to do is go fishing. Unfortunately, he chose the wrong lake. The fish inside are very upset.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Terminal</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cop uses a new piece of technology to scan a memory of a crime. Figure out what happened in this <i>bizarre</i> murder suicide.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are just a few stories out of the collection. Much more lies in wait for you deep below.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125490?t=1763566865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125490?t=1763566865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/41ce7ce382a1cef06b470712f9100ed0faf175fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763566865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/41ce7ce382a1cef06b470712f9100ed0faf175fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763566865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Discussion of murder/torture. Discussion of suicide. Gun violence."},"demos":[{"appid":4155370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeth Cutter is a collection of short horror stories. Each scenario is trying to deliver you something terrifying.\u00a0 Experience multiple distinct horror scenarios, each lasting from a few minutes to half an hour.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A FEW STORY EXAMPLES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Intruder</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man comes home from work to find that someone is in his house. What will he do to this heinous intruder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.poster.avif?t=1763566865\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.webm?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.mp4?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Father Martin Is Missing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a private investigator looking for a lost father of a newly constructed church. Read his notes and investigate the area to find out what happened to him. Hear the sounds of God's breath.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.poster.avif?t=1763566865\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.webm?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.mp4?t=1763566865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>My One Day Off</u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a man who gets one day off from his blue collar physical labor job, and all he wants to do is go fishing. Unfortunately, he chose the wrong lake. The fish inside are very upset.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Terminal</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cop uses a new piece of technology to scan a memory of a crime. Figure out what happened in this <i>bizarre</i> murder suicide.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are just a few stories out of the collection. Much more lies in wait for you deep below.</p>","developers":["Phillip Hubbard"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/804004bba64a4847c46141bdc00233d6c9ef79ab/header.jpg?t=1763566865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125490/686619541/1fc08f9ba57f5c8679758ae254d12019a4defeeb/1762411893/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763425217","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125490/686619541/1fc08f9ba57f5c8679758ae254d12019a4defeeb/1762411893/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763425217","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125490/686619541/1fc08f9ba57f5c8679758ae254d12019a4defeeb/1762411893/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763425217","id":257227490,"name":"Gameplay teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227490/e8d1bd8176a419fe6a7fd692141c79967900ca88/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763425217"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125490/1504576055/3f6b9c76a7590992dbabb26dd13a682b9fc8f79a/1761104774/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763425218","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr